// Title: ImagingDevices Unusual Parent/Child Processes
// Rule ID: f11f2808-adb4-46c0-802a-8660db50fa99
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.execution
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_imagingdevices_unusual_parents.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
